## Common kubectl Commands

```bash
# See all resources in hotel namespace
kubectl get all -n hotel

# Check pod logs
kubectl logs -l app=backend -n hotel
kubectl logs -l app=frontend -n hotel
kubectl logs mongodb-0 -n hotel

# Describe pod for debugging
kubectl describe pod <pod-name> -n hotel

# Check events
kubectl get events -n hotel

# Check services
kubectl get svc -n hotel

# Check ingress
kubectl get ingress -n hotel
```

