## Troubleshooting

**ImagePullBackOff:**
```bash
eval $(minikube docker-env)
docker build -t bharathyk2004/hotel-backend:latest ./backend
docker build -t bharathyk2004/hotel-frontend:latest ./frontend
# Make sure imagePullPolicy: Never is in both deployments
```

**MongoDB pod not ready:**
```bash
kubectl describe pod mongodb-0 -n hotel
kubectl logs mongodb-0 -n hotel
# MongoDB takes ~30 seconds to initialise
```

**Backend cannot connect to MongoDB:**
```bash
kubectl logs -l app=backend -n hotel
# Check MONGO_URI in backend configmap
kubectl get configmap backend-config -n hotel -o yaml
# URI must be: mongodb://mongodb:27017/hoteldb
```

**Ingress not working:**
```bash
kubectl get ingress -n hotel
# Check ADDRESS column is populated
minikube addons enable ingress
# Re-add hosts entry:
echo "$(minikube ip) hotel.local" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts
```

**Frontend shows blank page:**
```bash
kubectl logs -l app=frontend -n hotel
# Check nginx.conf proxy_pass points to backend:5050
```

---

## Cleanup

```bash
# Delete all hotel resources
kubectl delete namespace hotel

# Stop minikube
minikube stop

# Delete minikube (fresh start)
minikube delete
```

