---

## What This Project Demonstrates

```
✅ 3-tier architecture on Kubernetes
✅ Separate Deployment per tier
✅ StatefulSet for MongoDB (data persistence)
✅ PersistentVolumeClaim (data survives pod restart)
✅ ClusterIP Services for internal communication
✅ Nginx Ingress for HTTP routing
✅ ConfigMaps for environment configuration
✅ Resource requests and limits per tier
✅ Liveness and readiness probes
✅ Zero-downtime rolling updates
✅ Independent scaling per tier
✅ Data verification inside MongoDB pod
```

